        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_564828bfb62e4534bd14ec12e608276a",
      "statement": "The sensitive digest hashes the sorted hook pairs, the resolved absolute paths of out-of-project collections, and the non-default model URIs, so editing a hook, pointing a collection outside the project, or changing a custom model re-arms the gate, while in-project path edits and setting defaults do not.",
