      "id": "claim_53102e8b6cbd4c41b5612066ca28d971",
      "statement": "The env opt-ins QMD_TRUST_LOCAL_CONFIG and QMD_TRUST_UPDATE_HOOKS are each read through isTruthyEnv, which treats unset, empty, 0, false, off, no, and none as false after trimming and lowercasing, and treats any other value as opting in.",
